      "en": "Now before the feast of the Passover, Jesus, knowing that his time had come that he would depart from this world to the Father, having loved his own who were in the world, he loved them to the end.",
      "ko": "유월절 전에 예수께서 자기가 세상을 떠나 아버지께로 돌아가실 때가 이른줄 아시고 세상에 있는 자기 사람들을 사랑하시되 끝까지 사랑하시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "365ca5dec6ca52d6bcf7e08b865960e671e3f1c3a1721fff6ff8e9fee62c5496",
      "translation_text_hash": "118891ca584eab2fe4f6de83dc42f289a83d0c5d689a4ba8c81b477c0a999bf2",
