      "en": "Therefore having received that morsel, he went out immediately. It was night.",
      "ko": "유다가 그 조각을 받고 곧 나가니 밤이러라",
      "source_text_hash": "c8e77d0546a0b829836bd3f6bf73f05a0feeb4c78fc74f185790993c23ccfbbc",
      "translation_text_hash": "c14476be13d6f7bc4766fd03377ac5c092873358cb25421891aed564f465e041",
